,"赤身肉の一部を魚や鶏肉に置き換える"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"精白米や白小麦粉の一部を全粒穀物に置き換える"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"週に3回以上、お茶を飲む"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"毎日3〜4杯のコーヒーを、砂糖やミルクなしで飲む"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-27"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"毎日、十分な量の 5 単位（約 400 g）の果物と野菜を食べる"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"超加工食品（ポテトチップス、インスタントラーメン、菓子類、ファストフード）の摂取を控える"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"料理や暖房に石炭や薪を使わず、電気やガスに切り替える"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"熱いものは少し冷ましてから飲む。熱すぎる茶、スープ、コーヒーは避ける"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"日中は外出して日光を浴びる。一日中光を避けない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-32"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"BMIを20–25に保つ、過体重なら減量"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-33"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"週に4回以上の唐辛子の摂取"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-34"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"毎日1〜2サービングの乳製品またはヨーグルトを摂取"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-35"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"卵は禁止する必要はないが、毎日3〜4個も食べないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-36"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"条件が許すなら入浴を、シャワーだけで済ませない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-37"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"昼寝は30分以内に抑えること。1時間を超えないように。1〜2時間寝ないと持ちこたえられない場合は原因を調べること"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-38"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"徹夜明けの翌晩には睡眠を補うこと。週末まで溜め込まない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-39"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"夜勤の期間が長いほど心血管リスクは高まる。配置転換ができるなら早めに検討を"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/02-40","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"包装済みでSC番号がある食用油を購入すること。小規模な手作り・バラ売りのピーナッツ油は避ける"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-41"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"料理にラードやバターの代わりに植物油を使用：健康のために油を使い分ける必要はなく、亜麻仁油に心臓保護を期待しても意味がない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-42"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"炒め物や揚げ物の際は換気扇を回すこと。火をつけた瞬間から料理が終わるまで。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-43"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"閉経前後のほてりや寝汗が生活に支障をきたすなら、婦人科でホルモン療法の評価を受ける。我慢せず、自己判断で薬を買わず、心臓病予防にも使わない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/02-44"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"もともと犬を飼いたい人は毎日の散歩を歩行量に含める。長生きだけを目的に飼わない"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/02"},"children":["第2章"," ·"," ","ゆっくり死なないために"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"02-40"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["40"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["包装済みでSC番号がある食用油を購入すること。小規模な手作り・バラ売りのピーナッツ油は避ける"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["ピーナッツが湿気でカビるとアフラトキシンが発生します。これは明確な発がん物質であり、主に肝臓に悪影響を及ぼします。広州市が小規模な手作り業者を規制した後、手作り油を日常的に食べている住民の肝機能異常は約35%減少しました。広西の妊婦が手作りピーナント油を摂取した場合、子供の低出生体重のリスクは約90%高く、早産のリスクは約80%高くなります。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["購入場所を変えるだけで、費用はほぼ変わりません。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["アフラトキシンは、国際がん研究機関（IARC）によって 1 級の（発がん性が確定している）発がん性物質に分類されており、主に肝がんを引き起こします。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：包装済みでSC番号がある食用油を購入すること。小規模な手作り・バラ売りのピーナッツ油は避ける"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill